ack-Winged Dragon. Boreastorm + Black-Winged Dragon make Full Armor Master, and banishing both from the GY brings out Assault Dragon. Sudri's Synchro-only lock still allows Black-Winged Dragon, because it is a Synchro Monster. Summoning Vata first leads to the same board.", "own_choice": [0], "equivalent": ["A"], "grades": [{"label": "A", "grade": "best", "reason": "Summoning Vata now is a fine step: the full line still works with Sudri tributing Gofu afterward. The reason misreads Sudri's lock, though. It does not block Black-Winged Dragon, which is a Synchro Monster, and skipping the token would miss the Full Armor Master + Assault line."}], "confidence": "medium"}]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 27345, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4015, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 27345}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "564f6d43-7341-4e1b-89f0-9522332ed4da", "uuid": "0b40dfd6-c540-44a0-bfd3-d5792fcd7405", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:47:49.251Z", "request_id": "req_011CgGGrqWHNwB61XWjS8RGz", "wire_tool_inputs": {"toolu_016vFVzLaZXnP5dnFJ4TAtJW": {"positions": [{"position": "p37", "assessment": "Gofu (Lv5 Blackwing Tuner) + Harmattan at Lv2 makes 7, so Blackwing Armor Master can still be Synchro Summoned this turn. If Harmattan copies Sudri, Gofu or Nothung, it becomes Lv6, 7 or 8. Gofu plus that is 11, 12 or 13, and nothing in the Extra Deck matches, so the Synchro option is gone. The boost gains nothing and costs that line. Declining is right.", "own_choice": [0], "equivalent": ["A"], "grades": [{"label": "A", "grade": "best", "reason": "Declining keeps Harmattan at Lv2, which keeps the Gofu + Harmatta